     <td style="width: 93%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">The Company acquired Tremont Partners, Inc., a Connecticut-based investment management consulting firm.</p> </td>
    </tr>

