     <td style="width: 95%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Lynch spins&#160;off Morgan&#160;and Tremont Advisors to shareholders. Tremont later acquired by Oppenheimer.</p> </td>
    </tr>

