     <td style="width: 2%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px;">&#8226;</td>
     <td style="width: 93%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The Company sold its remaining stake in Spinnaker.</p> </td>
