     <td style="width: 93%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">M-tron Industries, Inc. acquired&#160;the assets of Champion Technologies, Inc. (spun-off from Motorola in the mid-1980s), expanding its product line to include voltage-controlled crystal oscillators ("VCXO"), temperature compensated crystal oscillators ("TCXO"), and timing solutions.</p> </td>
    </tr>

