     <td style="width: 95%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The direct investing business was launched (renamed&#160;the Merchant Investment segment in 2023)</p> </td>
