     <td style="width: 5%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><b>2022</b></p> </td>
     <td style="width: 95%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The Company completed&#160;the tax-free spin-off M-tron Industries, Inc. to shareholders.</p> </td>
    </tr>

