  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><i>2025 Compared to 2024</i></p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Loss&#160;Before Income Taxes</span></p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 1pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><i>Loss&#160;before income taxes</i>&#160;increased $221,&#160;or 56.5%,&#160;from $391&#160;in 2024 to $612&#160;in 2025&#160;primarily due to:</p>
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 1pt;">
