   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 3pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;">As of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, the Company has the following subsidiaries, including consolidated and unconsolidated VIEs:</p>
