   <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-top: 6pt;"><tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top; font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><td style="width: 2%; font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(a)</sup></p> </td><td style="width: 98%; font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">As of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>,&#160;included investments in money market mutual funds managed or advised by GAMCO Investors, Inc. or <em style="font: inherit;">one</em> of its subsidiaries.</p> </td></tr>
