   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;"><i><b>Intangible Assets, Net</b></i></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 3pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The components of intangible assets as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em> are summarized below:</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsTableTextBlock" id="c3148970" escape="true">
